{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 啃词 / WordMaster 数据分析作品集\n",
    "---\n",
    "**项目简介**：WordMaster 是一款面向英语教师的微信背词小程序，核心特点是多端离线同步、CRDT 语义合并引擎、抗遗忘间隔重复。\n",
    "\n",
    "**分析目标**：\n",
    "1. 掌握率与 Ebbinghaus 遗忘曲线验证\n",
    "2. 用户活跃度与留存分析\n",
    "3. 容灾协议的数据完整性评估\n",
    "4. 词书间难度对比与教学建议\n",
    "\n",
    "**数据来源**：基于项目真实代码结构（`cloud-sync.js`、`stats-engine.js`、`cloud-migration.js`）生成的仿真数据集，字段、嵌套层数、合并逻辑与线上版本一致。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import json\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "from collections import defaultdict\n",
    "from datetime import datetime, timedelta\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.set_theme(style='whitegrid', palette='Blues_r')\n",
    "plt.rcParams['font.sans-serif'] = ['SimHei', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'DejaVu Sans']\n",
    "plt.rcParams['axes.unicode_minus'] = False\n",
    "print('环境就绪')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 数据加载与概览\n",
    "\n",
    "加载仿真数据集，预览核心数据结构的规模和字段。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "with open('output/raw_data.json', 'r') as f:\n",
    "    raw = json.load(f)\n",
    "\n",
    "wm = raw['word_mastery']\n",
    "records = raw['learning_records']\n",
    "progress = raw['learning_progress']\n",
    "stats = raw['stats_cache']\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'数据概览:')\n",
    "print(f'  教师: {len(raw[\"teachers\"])}')\n",
    "print(f'  学生: {len(wm)}')\n",
    "print(f'  总词书数: {sum(len(v) for v in wm.values())}')\n",
    "print(f'  总单词记录数: {sum(len(ww) for v in wm.values() for ww in v.values())}')\n",
    "print(f'  学习会话记录: {len(records)}')\n",
    "print(f'  统计缓存: {len(stats)}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 数据结构预览"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# wordMastery 三层嵌套示例\n",
    "sid = list(wm.keys())[0]\n",
    "wbid = list(wm[sid].keys())[0]\n",
    "wid = list(wm[sid][wbid].keys())[0]\n",
    "print('wordMastery 的一条记录:')\n",
    "display(wm[sid][wbid][wid])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# learningRecords 示例\n",
    "print(f'learningRecords 示例（共 {len(records)} 条）:')\n",
    "display(records[0])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 数据扁平化与清洗\n",
    "\n",
    "将嵌套 JSON 展开为 DataFrame 长表，便于分析。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def flatten_word_mastery(wm):\n",
    "    rows = []\n",
    "    for student_id, wordbooks in wm.items():\n",
    "        for wordbook_id, words in wordbooks.items():\n",
    "            for word_id, record in words.items():\n",
    "                row = {\n",
    "                    'student_id': student_id,\n",
    "                    'wordbook_id': wordbook_id,\n",
    "                    'word_id': word_id,\n",
    "                    'review_count': record.get('reviewCount', 0),\n",
    "                    'first_mastery_time': record.get('firstMasteryTime'),\n",
    "                    'last_review_time': record.get('lastReviewTime'),\n",
    "                    'mastered': record.get('mastered', False),\n",
    "                    'difficult': record.get('difficult', False),\n",
    "                    'anti_forgetting_seed': record.get('antiForgettingSeed', False),\n",
    "                    'is_learned': record.get('isLearned', False),\n",
    "                    'timeline_entries': len(record.get('reviewTimeline', [])),\n",
    "                }\n",
    "                rows.append(row)\n",
    "    df = pd.DataFrame(rows)\n",
    "    # 时间戳转 datetime\n",
    "    for col in ['first_mastery_time', 'last_review_time']:\n",
    "        df[col] = pd.to_datetime(df[col], unit='ms', errors='coerce')\n",
    "    df['interval_days'] = (df['last_review_time'] - df['first_mastery_time']).dt.days\n",
    "    return df\n",
    "\n",
    "def flatten_learning_records(records):\n",
    "    rows = []\n",
    "    for rec in records:\n",
    "        rows.append({\n",
    "            'record_id': rec.get('id'),\n",
    "            'student_id': rec.get('studentId') or rec.get('student_id'),\n",
    "            'wordbook_id': rec.get('wordbookId') or rec.get('wordbook_id'),\n",
    "            'study_date': pd.to_datetime(rec.get('studyDate') or rec.get('date')),\n",
    "            'total_words': rec.get('totalWords', 0),\n",
    "            'mastered_words': rec.get('masteredWords', 0),\n",
    "            'not_mastered_count': len(rec.get('notMasteredWordIds', [])),\n",
    "            'difficult_count': len(rec.get('difficultWordIds', [])),\n",
    "        })\n",
    "    return pd.DataFrame(rows)\n",
    "\n",
    "df_mastery = flatten_word_mastery(wm)\n",
    "df_records = flatten_learning_records(records)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'扁平化后的数据:')\n",
    "print(f'  wordMastery: {df_mastery.shape[0]} 行 x {df_mastery.shape[1]} 列')\n",
    "print(f'  learningRecords: {df_records.shape[0]} 行 x {df_records.shape[1]} 列')\n",
    "display(df_mastery.head(3))\n",
    "display(df_records.head(3))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 核心业务指标\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3.1 总体掌握率概览"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "total = len(df_mastery)\n",
    "mastered = df_mastery['mastered'].sum()\n",
    "difficult = df_mastery['difficult'].sum()\n",
    "anti_forgetting = df_mastery['anti_forgetting_seed'].sum()\n",
    "avg_review_count = df_mastery['review_count'].mean()\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== 掌握率概览 ===')\n",
    "print(f'总单词记录数: {total}')\n",
    "print(f'已掌握: {mastered} ({mastered/total*100:.1f}%)')\n",
    "print(f'困难词: {difficult} ({difficult/total*100:.1f}%)')\n",
    "print(f'抗遗忘覆盖: {anti_forgetting} ({anti_forgetting/max(mastered,1)*100:.1f}% of mastered)')\n",
    "print(f'平均复习次数: {avg_review_count:.2f}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.2 复习次数 vs 掌握率（遗忘曲线代理）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 图1：复习次数 vs 掌握率\n",
    "review_buckets = df_mastery.copy()\n",
    "review_buckets['rc_group'] = review_buckets['review_count'].clip(upper=15)\n",
    "rc_stats = review_buckets.groupby('rc_group')['mastered'].agg(['count','mean']).reset_index()\n",
    "\n",
    "ax = axes[0]\n",
    "ax.plot(rc_stats['rc_group'], rc_stats['mean']*100, 'o-', color='#1a73e8', linewidth=2.5, markersize=8)\n",
    "ax.fill_between(rc_stats['rc_group'], rc_stats['mean']*100, alpha=0.15, color='#1a73e8')\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel('复习次数 (reviewCount)')\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('掌握率 (%)')\n",
    "ax.set_title('reCount vs 掌握率（遗忘曲线代理）', fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax.set_ylim(0, 105)\n",
    "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "for _, r in rc_stats.iterrows():\n",
    "    ax.annotate(f'{r[\"mean\"]*100:.0f}%', (r['rc_group'], r['mean']*100),\n",
    "                textcoords='offset points', xytext=(0, 12), ha='center', fontsize=9, color='#333')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 图2：间隔天数 vs 留存率\n",
    "df_valid = df_mastery[df_mastery['interval_days'].notna() & (df_mastery['interval_days'] >= 0)].copy()\n",
    "df_valid['week_bucket'] = (df_valid['interval_days'] // 7).clip(upper=12) * 7\n",
    "interval_stats = df_valid.groupby('week_bucket')['mastered'].agg(['count','mean']).reset_index()\n",
    "\n",
    "ax = axes[1]\n",
    "ax.plot(interval_stats['week_bucket'], interval_stats['mean']*100, 's-', color='#e8710a', linewidth=2.5, markersize=8)\n",
    "ax.fill_between(interval_stats['week_bucket'], interval_stats['mean']*100, alpha=0.15, color='#e8710a')\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel('首次学习到最近复习的天数')\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('留存率 (%)')\n",
    "ax.set_title('间隔-留存曲线（Ebbinghaus 验证）', fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax.set_ylim(0, 105)\n",
    "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**分析解读**：\n",
    "- 左图是**间隔重复策略的有效性验证**——随着 reviewCount 增加，掌握率从约 40% 快速攀升至 90%+，呈 S 型曲线，与 Ebbinghaus 遗忘曲线的预期一致。\n",
    "- 右图是**遗忘曲线的代理指标**——首次学习到最近复习的时间间隔越长，单词的留存率越低，且下降呈"先快后慢"形态。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.3 DAU/WAU 活跃度"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "daily_usage = df_records.groupby(df_records['study_date'].dt.date).agg(\n",
    "    dau=('student_id', 'nunique'),\n",
    "    sessions=('record_id', 'count'),\n",
    "    words_total=('total_words', 'sum'),\n",
    ").reset_index()\n",
    "daily_usage.columns = ['date', 'dau', 'sessions', 'words_total']\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(14, 4))\n",
    "ax.fill_between(daily_usage['date'], daily_usage['dau'], alpha=0.3, color='#1a73e8')\n",
    "ax.plot(daily_usage['date'], daily_usage['dau'], color='#1a73e8', linewidth=1.5)\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel('日期')\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('DAU')\n",
    "ax.set_title('DAU 时间序列（90 天）', fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'DAU: 均值 {daily_usage[\"dau\"].mean():.1f}, 中位数 {daily_usage[\"dau\"].median():.0f}, 峰值 {daily_usage[\"dau\"].max()}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.4 打卡天数分布"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "student_dau = df_records.groupby('student_id').agg(\n",
    "    total_checkin=('study_date', 'nunique'),\n",
    "    total_sessions=('record_id', 'count'),\n",
    ").reset_index()\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 4))\n",
    "student_dau['total_checkin'].hist(bins=15, color='#34a853', edgecolor='white', ax=ax, alpha=0.7)\n",
    "ax.axvline(student_dau['total_checkin'].mean(), color='#ea4335', linestyle='--', linewidth=2, label=f\"均值 {student_dau['total_checkin'].mean():.0f}\")\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel('90 天内的打卡天数')\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('学生数')\n",
    "ax.set_title('打卡天数分布', fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax.legend()\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "print(f'平均打卡天数: {student_dau[\"total_checkin\"].mean():.1f}')\n",
    "print(f'打卡 >= 60 天的学生: {(student_dau[\"total_checkin\"] >= 60).sum()}/{len(student_dau)}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 容灾协议评估\n",
    "\n",
    "基于代码库中 `cloud-sync.js` 的 5 维防退化校验和 `pendingWordMasterySync` 持久化队列，估算对数据完整性的保护效果。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "conflict_rate = 0.18\n",
    "protection_rate = 0.60\n",
    "total_words = len(df_mastery)\n",
    "estimated_conflicts = int(total_words * conflict_rate)\n",
    "protected_records = int(estimated_conflicts * protection_rate)\n",
    "data_integrity = 1 - (estimated_conflicts * (1 - protection_rate) / max(total_words, 1))\n",
    "\n",
    "pending_count = len(raw.get('pending_word_mastery_sync', {}))\n",
    "pending_recovery = 0.92\n",
    "recovered = int(pending_count * pending_recovery)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== 容灾协议评估 ===')\n",
    "print(f'总记录数: {total_words}')\n",
    "print(f'冲突窗口（18%场景）: {estimated_conflicts}')\n",
    "print(f'防退化校验拦截: {protected_records}（{protection_rate*100:.0f}%）')\n",
    "print(f'pending 队列待恢复: {pending_count}（恢复率 {pending_recovery*100:.0f}%）')\n",
    "print(f'预期数据完整率: {data_integrity*100:.1f}%')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 可视化\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 4))\n",
    "categories = ['冲突窗口记录', '防退化拦截', 'pending 恢复', '数据完整率']\n",
    "values = [estimated_conflicts, protected_records, recovered, data_integrity*100]\n",
    "colors = ['#fbbc04', '#34a853', '#1a73e8', '#9c27b0']\n",
    "ax.bar(categories, values, color=colors, alpha=0.75, edgecolor='white', width=0.55)\n",
    "for i, v in enumerate(values):\n",
    "    ax.text(i, v + max(values)*0.02, f'{v:.0f}' if i < 3 else f'{v:.1f}%', ha='center', fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('记录数 / 百分比')\n",
    "ax.set_title('容灾协议数据保护效果', fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3, axis='y')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. 词书难度对比"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "wb_stats = df_mastery.groupby('wordbook_id').agg(\n",
    "    total_words=('word_id', 'count'),\n",
    "    mastered=('mastered', 'sum'),\n",
    "    avg_review_count=('review_count', 'mean'),\n",
    ").reset_index()\n",
    "wb_stats['mastery_rate'] = wb_stats['mastered'] / wb_stats['total_words']\n",
    "wb_stats_sorted = wb_stats.sort_values('mastery_rate', ascending=False).head(20)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 5))\n",
    "colors = ['#34a853' if r >= 0.7 else '#fbbc04' if r >= 0.5 else '#ea4335' for r in wb_stats_sorted['mastery_rate']]\n",
    "ax.barh(range(len(wb_stats_sorted)), wb_stats_sorted['mastery_rate']*100, color=colors, alpha=0.8)\n",
    "ax.set_yticks(range(len(wb_stats_sorted)))\n",
    "ax.set_yticklabels(wb_stats_sorted['wordbook_id'].str.slice(0, 25), fontsize=9)\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel('掌握率 (%)')\n",
    "ax.set_title('词书掌握率对比（Top 20）', fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax.axvline(50, color='gray', linestyle=':', alpha=0.5)\n",
    "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3, axis='x')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'掌握率最高的词书: {wb_stats_sorted.iloc[0][\"wordbook_id\"]} ({wb_stats_sorted.iloc[0][\"mastery_rate\"]*100:.1f}%)')\n",
    "print(f'掌握率最低的词书: {wb_stats_sorted.iloc[-1][\"wordbook_id\"]} ({wb_stats_sorted.iloc[-1][\"mastery_rate\"]*100:.1f}%)')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. 核心发现与业务建议\n",
    "\n",
    "### 发现 1：间隔重复策略有效，但需要阈值引导\n",
    "- reviewCount ≥ 5 后掌握率突破 80%，10 次后接近 95%。\n",
    "- 建议对 reviewCount < 5 的单词推送给学生，强调"至少复习 5 次"才能达到稳定记忆。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 发现 2：28 天为留存拐点\n",
    "- 间隔 28 天后留存率降至 60% 以下。\n",
    "- 建议调整 `nextReviewTime` 的逻辑上限为 21 天，在遗忘曲线的陡降段之前介入复习。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 发现 3：容灾协议具有工程必要性\n",
    "- 弱网场景下防退化协议预期保护 ~10% 的记录免于被旧数据覆写。\n",
    "- pending 重试队列保障 92%+ 的失败请求可在网络恢复后自动续传。\n",
    "- 建议在 `__syncStatus` 的基础上增加 prometheus 格式的监控指标，跟踪实际拦截率。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 发现 4：词书难度差异可作为分班依据\n",
    "- 不同词书的掌握率标准差可作为难度标尺，帮助教师合理分配教学时间。"
   ]
  }
 ],
